        <mxCell id="10" value="&lt;b&gt;Block Functions and Interfaces&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;u_ctrl / control_unit (src/control_unit.v): exact opcode/funct decode; 20 supported instructions; invalid encodings assert illegal_instr with side-effect controls at zero.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;u_datapath / datapath (src/datapath.v): PC, decode fields, RF, ALU, memories, writeback and PC selection. Fault handling suppresses commit and holds PC; halted/fault flags clear on reset.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solid thin arrows = hierarchy. Dashed arrows = functional control/data flow." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#000000;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1" vlsit_library_sha256="15DFB183E267D2A94F8CAB316E01EB3D2E9D2F9C006DC816790A394F4123506C" vlsit_library_entry="32" vlsit_library_cell="2" vlsit_library_instance="panel_l1">
